WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.154
Some dreams begin far from a stadium.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.604
Aarav is ten. His bat is second-hand. His
dream is his own.

3
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.511
Six after six. And then, the shot that wins it
for his school.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.867
Dad records it all. That evening, he shares
his proudest moment on iAdMe.

5
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.797
A local cricket coach sees the video. Watches
it again. And reaches out.

6
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:38.521
I would love to coach him. Free of cost. He's
going to be a boy wonder.

7
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:46.781
For his parents, it's more than an offer. It's
someone else believing in their boy.

8
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.610
One video. One connection. And a dream that
suddenly feels a little closer.

9
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.345
iAdMe. Share your talent. Let your story be
seen.
